{"slug": "kim-seversons-italian-meatballs", "nyt_id": 11519, "url": "https://cooking.nytimes.com/recipes/11519-kim-seversons-italian-meatballs", "name": "Kim Severson’s Italian Meatballs", "author": "Kim Severson", "description": "These are the meatballs you want to serve with spaghetti sauce — my mother Anne Marie Zappa’s is the one I’d use, but your favorite will work as well. Key to the recipe is a light hand in the mixing.", "servings": {"text": "About 16 meatballs", "min": 16, "max": 16, "yield_type": "pieces"}, "time": {"prep_minutes": null, "cook_minutes": null, "total_minutes": 20, "raw": {"total": "20 minutes"}}, "ingredients": [{"position": 1, "raw": "2 pounds ground beef", "group": null, "quantity": 2.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "lb", "item": "ground beef", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 2, "raw": "1 cup fresh bread crumbs", "group": null, "quantity": 1.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "cup", "item": "fresh bread crumbs", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 3, "raw": "½ cup finely grated Parmesan", "group": null, "quantity": 0.5, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "cup", "item": "finely grated parmesan", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 4, "raw": "1 heaping tablespoon chopped fresh basil", "group": null, "quantity": 1.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": null, "item": "heaping tablespoon chopped fresh basil", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 5, "raw": "1 heaping tablespoon chopped fresh parsley", "group": null, "quantity": 1.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": null, "item": "heaping tablespoon chopped fresh parsley", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 6, "raw": "1 teaspoon kosher salt", "group": null, "quantity": 1.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "tsp", "item": "kosher salt", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 7, "raw": "½ teaspoon black pepper", "group": null, "quantity": 0.5, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "tsp", "item": "black pepper", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 8, "raw": "⅛ teaspoon ground cayenne pepper", "group": null, "quantity": 0.125, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "tsp", "item": "ground cayenne pepper", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 9, "raw": "2 cloves garlic, minced", "group": null, "quantity": 2.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "clove", "item": "garlic", "preparation": "minced", "optional": false}, {"position": 10, "raw": "2 eggs", "group": null, "quantity": 2.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": null, "item": "eggs", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 11, "raw": "3 tablespoons olive oil", "group": null, "quantity": 3.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "tbsp", "item": "olive oil", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 12, "raw": "Spaghetti sauce", "group": null, "quantity": null, "quantity_max": null, "unit": null, "item": "spaghetti sauce", "preparation": null, "optional": false}], "steps": [{"position": 1, "text": "In a large bowl, mix all ingredients except olive oil by hand, using a light touch. Take a portion of meat in hand, and roll between palms to form a ball that is firmly packed but not compressed. Repeat, making each meatball about 2 inches in diameter."}, {"position": 2, "text": "In a large, heavy pot heat olive oil over medium-high heat. When it shimmers, add meatballs in batches. Do not crowd. Brown well on bottoms before turning, or meatballs will break apart. Continue cooking until browned all over. Remove meatballs to a plate as each batch is finished. Let meatballs cool slightly; cover and refrigerate until needed."}, {"position": 3, "text": "Serve with spaghetti sauce."}], "nutrition": {"calories": 200.7, "protein_g": 12.4, "carbohydrates_g": 1.8, "fat_g": 15.7, "saturated_fat_g": 5.6, "trans_fat_g": 0.7, "cholesterol_mg": 63.4, "sodium_mg": 169.6, "fiber_g": 0.1, "sugar_g": 0.2, "unsaturated_fat_g": 8.2, "source": "nyt", "basis": "per_serving", "computed_with": null}, "tags": {"cuisine": ["italian"], "diet": [], "course": ["main course"], "meal": ["dinner"], "occasion": [], "other": ["beef", "fry", "quick"]}, "images": [{"url": "https://static01.nyt.com/images/2013/12/12/dining/recipes-meatballs/recipes-meatballs-facebookJumbo-v2.jpg", "alt": "Italian meatballs.", "primary": true}], "rating": {"average": 5.0, "count": 946}, "video_url": null, "comment_count": null, "published_at": "2007-02-21", "scraped_at": "2026-09-07T02:23:09.872198+00:00", "scraper_version": "1.0.0"}
{"slug": "king-crab-rolls", "nyt_id": 11553, "url": "https://cooking.nytimes.com/recipes/11553-king-crab-rolls", "name": "King Crab Rolls", "author": "Ken Gross", "description": "Ken Gross", "servings": {"text": "Serves 4", "min": 4, "max": 4, "yield_type": "servings"}, "time": {"prep_minutes": null, "cook_minutes": null, "total_minutes": 10, "raw": {"total": "10 minutes"}}, "ingredients": [{"position": 1, "raw": "9 ounces shelled king crab meat", "group": null, "quantity": 9.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "oz", "item": "shelled king crab meat", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 2, "raw": "1 tablespoon chopped celery leaves", "group": null, "quantity": 1.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "tbsp", "item": "chopped celery leaves", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 3, "raw": "2 tablespoons mayonnaise (preferably Hellmann's)", "group": null, "quantity": 2.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "tbsp", "item": "mayonnaise (preferably hellmann's)", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 4, "raw": "1 tablespoon lemon juice", "group": null, "quantity": 1.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "tbsp", "item": "lemon juice", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 5, "raw": "Fleur de sel", "group": null, "quantity": null, "quantity_max": null, "unit": null, "item": "fleur de sel", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 6, "raw": "Freshly ground black pepper", "group": null, "quantity": null, "quantity_max": null, "unit": null, "item": "freshly ground black pepper", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 7, "raw": "Red-pepper flakes", "group": null, "quantity": null, "quantity_max": null, "unit": null, "item": "red-pepper flakes", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 8, "raw": "2 to 3 tablespoons butter", "group": null, "quantity": 2.0, "quantity_max": 3.0, "unit": "tbsp", "item": "butter", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 9, "raw": "4 hot-dog buns", "group": null, "quantity": 4.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": null, "item": "hot-dog buns", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 10, "raw": "1 tablespoon minced chives", "group": null, "quantity": 1.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "tbsp", "item": "minced chives", "preparation": null, "optional": false}], "steps": [{"position": 1, "text": "Squeeze the crab meat between your hands to remove all the moisture and then break into large pieces and place in a large bowl. Add the celery leaves, mayonnaise and lemon juice and mix well. Season to taste with salt, pepper and red-pepper flakes."}, {"position": 2, "text": "In a nonstick skillet set over low heat, heat the butter until it begins to foam. Brown the hot-dog buns on both sides and set aside to cool slightly."}, {"position": 3, "text": "Spread ¼ of the mixture into each bun and sprinkle with chives. Serve immediately."}], "nutrition": {"calories": 292.1, "protein_g": 15.9, "carbohydrates_g": 22.7, "fat_g": 15.0, "saturated_fat_g": 5.8, "trans_fat_g": 0.0, "cholesterol_mg": 83.8, "sodium_mg": 619.9, "fiber_g": 1.0, "sugar_g": 3.4, "unsaturated_fat_g": 8.5, "source": "nyt", "basis": "per_serving", "computed_with": null}, "tags": {"cuisine": [], "diet": [], "course": ["side dish"], "meal": [], "occasion": [], "other": ["crab", "easy", "quick", "sandwiches"]}, "images": [], "rating": {"average": 4.0, "count": 59}, "video_url": null, "comment_count": null, "published_at": "2007-07-15", "scraped_at": "2026-09-07T02:25:06.137370+00:00", "scraper_version": "1.0.0"}
